'''Cosmic Warriors''' (めぐりあう戦士, ''Meguriau Senshi'', '''Meeting of Warriors''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 14.7 Update|Version 14.7]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

==Effect==
Starting Money UP (M): Wallet starts with 500¢.

